00:06:11.966 --> 00:06:16.664
The reason why US pilots could win
in every dog fight in a really tough

00:06:16.664 --> 00:06:22.040
competition is that they would observe,
orient, decide, and act faster.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:25.820
Move through the traditions faster.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:30.709
This is called getting inside of
an opponent's loop, learning loop,

00:06:30.709 --> 00:06:32.180
so you learn faster.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:36.480
You, in fact,
